    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_9_start_7111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1199,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_9_start_7111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Everyone who believes in the Monolith is completely nuts. They keep banging on about it but nobody actually knows what's in the center of the Zone. An invisible crystal that fell from the skies... ha-ha-ha! I reckon one of the secret labs blew up - I mean some stalkers used to work in a few of them. But, obviously, you can't bomb the Zone. Not only will the radiation spread all over the world, half of Europe would be flattened by the Zone's reaction. \"Someone\" has gone totally mad lately - I heard they're killing normal stalkers for no reason at all. How do you like that? Damn fanatics.",
      "JA_current": "モノリスを信じてる奴は、どうかしてる。いつもその話ばかりしてるが、ゾーンの中心に何があるかなんて誰も知らない。空から落ちてきた透明な結晶だって？ ははっ！ どこかの秘密研究所が爆発したんだろう。ストーカーが研究所で働いてたって話もあるしな。だが、ゾーンを爆撃するなんてできるわけがない。放射能が世界中に広がるだけじゃない。ゾーンの反応でヨーロッパの半分が吹き飛ぶぞ。最近「誰か」がすっかり狂ったらしい。普通のストーカーまで理由もなく殺してるそうだ。どう思う？ クソみたいな狂信者どもだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_9_start",
          "phrase_id": "7111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_9_start_71111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1202,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_9_start_71111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I think it deserves some attention.",
      "JA_current": "ちゃんと調べる価値はあると思うけどな。",
